<title>FRANCE: MOTOR RACING-TWR PORSCHE PROTOTYPE WINS LE MANS 24 HOURS.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-TWR PORSCHE PROTOTYPE WINS LE MANS 24 HOURS.</headline>
<dateline>LE MANS, France 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A TWR Porsche prototype entered by German team Joest won the Le Mans 24 Hours race on Sunday with Italian Michele Alboreto at the wheel at the finish.</p>
<p>Alboreto's co-drivers were Swede Stefan Johansson and Tom Kristensen of Denmark.</p>
